# governance-registry cleanup — WFB-BASE-MERGE

This patch drops the three superseded project entries from
`infra/axi-workspace-governance/workspace.json` and the
related path references in
`infra/axi-workspace-governance/docs/{ownership-matrix,
project-catalog,integration-map,project-handoff}.md`. It
belongs to the **governance** repo
(`/Volumes/code/workspace/infra/axi-workspace-governance/`),
not the workbench repo.

It is staged here in the workbench tree only as a portable
artefact for the owner to copy across when ready — the
governance repo is independent and the workbench merge into
dev (commit 6bf7d674) does not touch the governance files.

## When to apply

After the workbench merge commit `6bf7d674 Merge branch
'chore/merge-baseline-projects-2026-09-20' into dev` is
pushed to origin and the owner confirms the new
architecture is stable. Earliest reasonable moment: when
the workbench `apps/axi-artboard` / `apps/resource-orchestration`
/ `apps/axi-docs` deployments are confirmed working.

## How to apply

```bash
cd /Volumes/code/workspace/infra/axi-workspace-governance
git checkout -b chore/wfb-base-merge-cleanup-2026-09-20
git apply /Volumes/code/workspace/projects/axi-workbench/infra/\
  axi-workspace-governance/patches/2026-09-20-wfb-base-merge-cleanup.patch

# Or: copy the patch body into a real patch file and
# git apply /path/to/copied.patch

# 1. Drop the three project entries from
#    workspace.json's "projects" array (lines 366-408 and
#    462-487) and the "allowedProjectMonorepos" entry
#    "../../projects/axi-docs" (line 701).
# 2. Update docs/ownership-matrix.md, docs/project-catalog.md,
#    docs/integration-map.md, docs/project-handoff.md to
#    reflect the merge.

pnpm workspace:registry:sync   # regenerate the generated catalog
pnpm workspace:audit          # verify the patch was clean

git add -A
git commit -m "chore(governance): drop merged projects after WFB-BASE-MERGE"
git push -u origin chore/wfb-base-merge-cleanup-2026-09-20
```

